{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111629","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111629/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111629/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111629/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111629","id":3512407916,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6tlm3G","number":111629,"title":"User defined default project directory for Project Manager","user":{"login":"Cautami","id":219921783,"node_id":"U_kgDODRu9dw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/219921783?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami","html_url":"https://github.com/Cautami","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-10-14T05:24:24Z","updated_at":"2025-10-15T07:21:04Z","closed_at":"2025-10-15T04:38:22Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111629","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111629","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111629.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111629.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This PR aims to allow the user to set the default location of where new projects are created. \r\n\r\n[Screencast_20251014_011447.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/677853df-7b85-4cb2-b598-a5159eb6c8cb)\r\n\r\nI've marked it as draft as it needs testing, and I'm unsure if this is the right way of implementing it.\r\n\r\nAll references to `filesystem/directories/default_project_path` have been changed to `../user_defined_project_path`.\r\ndefault_project_path is now _always_ the Godot default location, this is so the user can delete their custom directory and see a placeholder of where the original directory was.\r\n\r\n`user_defined_project_path` is set to the same value as default_project_path on creation, but can be changed via the settings menu. \r\nIn theory, this shouldn't cause any loss of functionality for users used to this, and should only serve to improve the experience.\r\n\r\nI still need to add translations (or well, the support for such) and change the naming(?), perhaps calling the user_defined option the \"default\" in the settings menu is misleading? Even though it is true...\r\nOr perhaps call user_defined -> default, and call default... something else I guess?\r\n\r\nI'm also toying with the idea of adding a reset button that resets the path to the true default, but given no other option has this functionality I'm unsure if it'd fit. ","closed_by":{"login":"Cautami","id":219921783,"node_id":"U_kgDODRu9dw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/219921783?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami","html_url":"https://github.com/Cautami","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111629/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111629/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}